<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Pacific Challenger -</p>
<p>120,000 tonnes coal Newcastle/Kaohsiung 10-20/12 $6.00 fio 35,000 shex/28,000 shex China Steel.</p>
<p>TBN 140,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Sines Dec $5.65 fio scale load/30,000 shinc Portline.</p>
<p>ORE - CSK Tribute - 150,000 tonnes Tubarao/Gijon end Nov low $5.00s fio six days shinc Ensidesa.</p>
<p>Fixtures reported from New York on Friday.</p>
</text>
